# C's `&&` and `||`: one DS0111 each, with fixes. The tree keeps `and` above `or` precedence.
mode: syntax
---- query
'orders.csv' | where amount > 10 && amount < 100 || customerId == "c-001"
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..74
  PIPELINE@0..73
    LITERAL@0..12
      STRING@0..12 "'orders.csv'"
    WHITESPACE@12..13 " "
    PIPE@13..14 "|"
    WHITESPACE@14..15 " "
    WHERE_OP@15..73
      IDENT@15..20 "where"
      WHITESPACE@20..21 " "
      BIN_EXPR@21..73
        BIN_EXPR@21..48
          BIN_EXPR@21..32
            NAME_REF@21..27
              IDENT@21..27 "amount"
            WHITESPACE@27..28 " "
            GT@28..29 ">"
            WHITESPACE@29..30 " "
            LITERAL@30..32
              LONG@30..32 "10"
          WHITESPACE@32..33 " "
          AMP2@33..35 "&&"
          WHITESPACE@35..36 " "
          BIN_EXPR@36..48
            NAME_REF@36..42
              IDENT@36..42 "amount"
            WHITESPACE@42..43 " "
            LT@43..44 "<"
            WHITESPACE@44..45 " "
            LITERAL@45..48
              LONG@45..48 "100"
        WHITESPACE@48..49 " "
        PIPE2@49..51 "||"
        WHITESPACE@51..52 " "
        BIN_EXPR@52..73
          NAME_REF@52..62
            IDENT@52..62 "customerId"
          WHITESPACE@62..63 " "
          EQ2@63..65 "=="
          WHITESPACE@65..66 " "
          LITERAL@66..73
            STRING@66..73 "\"c-001\""
  WHITESPACE@73..74 "\n"

error[DS0111]: `&&` is not an operator
  --> query:1:34
  |
1 | 'orders.csv' | where amount > 10 && amount < 100 || customerId == "c-001"
  |                                  ^^
  |
  = help: use `and` to require both conditions: `amount > 10 and amount < 100`

error[DS0111]: `||` is not an operator
  --> query:1:50
  |
1 | 'orders.csv' | where amount > 10 && amount < 100 || customerId == "c-001"
  |                                                  ^^
  |
  = help: use `or` to accept either condition

with the machine-applicable fixes applied:
    'orders.csv' | where amount > 10 and amount < 100 or customerId == "c-001"
which parses without errors
